---
manual: element.edit_line
lines: [1980, 1980]
testability: api
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  edit_line
end
----------- test code
click_on edit_line
type_text "one"
press_key "\n"
type_text "two"

refute_includes edit_line.text, "\n", "Return never adds a line to a single-line box"
assert_equal "onetwo", edit_line.text
